# ---- on the server, not in the repo ----
# Once this repo deploys to micahburger.com (2026-11-13), its public_html
# also holds other sites' folders: lattice2026.micahburger.com's and
# applicants.micahburger.com's document roots live inside it, plus
# Hostinger's own .private. Hostinger's Git publisher keeps whatever this
# file matches ("Preserving paths matched by .gitignore" in its log) and
# may clear the rest, so listing them here is what stops a deploy of this
# repo from wiping those sites. Never commit anything at these paths.
/lattice2026/
/applicants/
/.private/
